      "ANNIE: Can we help you?\nMADISON: I’m okay.",
      "ANNIE: Jesus. It’s like “Night of the Living Dead” in here.\nMICHELLE: I am not dressed for this nonsense.",
      "ANNIE: Yeah, you brought her last week. You work at Forever 21, right?\nMADISON: I work at Sephora.\nANNIE: I’m confused.",
      "MADISON: On the right or the left. I don’t want to go in the wrong room.\nANNIE: It’ll be the one with the toilet.\nMADISON: ‘Kay.\nMICHELLE: Where’d you meet her? At a TED talk?",
      "MICHELLE: I’m not nervous. Who’s turn is it?\nANNIE: I think it’s Max’s turn. It’s somebody’s turn. Somebody should go now."
